{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"查尔斯·达尔文·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"charles-darwin","categoryLabel":"查尔斯·达尔文","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/29_charles-darwin/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"查尔斯-达尔文的核心贡献\">查尔斯·达尔文的核心贡献</h1><p>本卷聚焦达尔文留给科学的核心思想遗产。如果说生平卷讲述他&quot;如何成为达尔文&quot;，本卷则系统梳理他究竟为人类的知识贡献了什么——那是一组彻底重塑生物学的根本观念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>达尔文人物 hub 共六卷，彼此分工明确，避免重复展开同一事实：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>关注</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1_生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的人生与著作诞生过程</td>\n<td>&quot;理论怎么形成的&quot;在生平卷；&quot;理论是什么&quot;在本卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2_核心贡献（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>四大科学思想本身</strong></td>\n<td>自然选择·共同祖先·性选择·证据与综合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3_思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他的思维方式与方法论</td>\n<td>&quot;如何论证/渐变主义/谨慎风格&quot;在方法卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4_主要著作</a></td>\n<td>各部著作的书志与内容</td>\n<td>著作作为&quot;出版物&quot;在著作卷；其思想内核在本卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5_影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>理论之后的影响</td>\n<td>&quot;理论塑造了什么&quot;在遗产卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>争论、滥用与史学评价</td>\n<td>社会达尔文主义、优生学滥用在争议卷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本卷讲&quot;达尔文贡献了哪些科学思想及其逻辑&quot;</strong>；它们如何诞生、如何被论证、产生何种影响、引发何种争议，分别交给其余五卷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条线索\">三条线索</h2><p>本卷沿三条线索展开：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>自然选择与共同祖先</strong>——演化的核心机制（&quot;如何演化&quot;）与生命之树的图景（&quot;演化成什么图景&quot;）。</li>\n<li><strong>性选择与人类演化</strong>——繁殖竞争这一独立塑造力，以及把演化逻辑大胆贯彻到人类自身起源的勇气。</li>\n<li><strong>证据与综合</strong>——支撑理论的多学科证据网络，以及其思想在二十世纪与遗传学融合、形成现代综合论的历程。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[自然选择机制] --&gt; B[共同祖先与生命之树]&#10;    B --&gt; C[性选择理论]&#10;    C --&gt; D[人类的由来]&#10;    A --&gt; E[多条证据线索]&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[从达尔文到现代综合论]&#10;    D --&gt; F\">flowchart LR\n    A[自然选择机制] --&gt; B[共同祖先与生命之树]\n    B --&gt; C[性选择理论]\n    C --&gt; D[人类的由来]\n    A --&gt; E[多条证据线索]\n    B --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[从达尔文到现代综合论]\n    D --&gt; F</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/early-life-and-voyage/the-voyage-of-the-beagle\">1_life-and-times/1_early-life-and-voyage/2_the-voyage-of-the-beagle.md</a> 了解贝格尔号航行如何孕育这些观念。</li>\n<li><strong>核心主线</strong>：<a href=\"natural-selection/the-mechanism-of-natural-selection\">自然选择机制</a> → <a href=\"natural-selection/common-descent-and-the-tree-of-life\">共同祖先</a> → <a href=\"evidence-and-synthesis/the-lines-of-evidence\">证据线索</a> → <a href=\"evidence-and-synthesis/from-darwin-to-the-modern-synthesis\">现代综合论</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶支线</strong>：<a href=\"sexual-selection-and-humans/the-theory-of-sexual-selection\">性选择理论</a> → <a href=\"sexual-selection-and-humans/the-descent-of-man\">人类的由来</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完本卷可转向 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5_影响与遗产</a> 看这些思想如何改变世界，或 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_争议与评价</a> 审视其边界与被滥用的历史。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些贡献共同构成了现代生物学的理论基石。理解达尔文的核心贡献，就是理解人类如何第一次为生命的多样性与统一性，找到了一个自然的、无需诉诸超自然力量的解释。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-selection","title":"自然选择理论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/natural-selection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-mechanism-of-natural-selection","title":"自然选择的机制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/natural-selection/the-mechanism-of-natural-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"common-descent-and-the-tree-of-life","title":"共同祖先与生命之树","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/natural-selection/common-descent-and-the-tree-of-life"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sexual-selection-and-humans","title":"性选择与人类演化","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/sexual-selection-and-humans","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-theory-of-sexual-selection","title":"性选择理论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/sexual-selection-and-humans/the-theory-of-sexual-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-descent-of-man","title":"《人类的由来》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/sexual-selection-and-humans/the-descent-of-man"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"evidence-and-synthesis","title":"证据基础与现代综合","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/evidence-and-synthesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-lines-of-evidence","title":"多条证据线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/evidence-and-synthesis/the-lines-of-evidence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"from-darwin-to-the-modern-synthesis","title":"从达尔文到现代综合论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/core-contributions/evidence-and-synthesis/from-darwin-to-the-modern-synthesis"}]}]}